{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b858a60d-7039-8f97-9574-d92577183361",
  "created_at": "2026-02-03T09:45:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "David Singh",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:43:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:43:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, morning. David Singh. I'm over at 318 Ocean Avenue, Ocean Drive side. I want to put up a fence and I need to know what the rules are."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:43:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. What kind of fence are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:43:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Side yard. I want to close it in for my granddaughter, she's a toddler, runs everywhere. Pressure-treated wood, six feet tall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:43:47-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Six feet is on the tall side. Generally a fence that high does need a permit, and there can be rules on height depending on where it sits on the lot and whether it's facing the street. You'd fill out an application and usually include a simple sketch of the lot with the fence line marked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:44:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So paperwork. Yeah. That's the way it goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:44:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. Is the side yard facing the street, or is it between you and a neighbor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:44:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Between me and the neighbor. Back part, not the street side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:44:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, that helps. Still, you'd want the application in so we can confirm placement and height."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:44:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "How long does it take to get approved? I'd like to start soon as the ground's workable."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:44:32-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For a plain fence it's usually not long, a matter of days to a couple of weeks, depending on how busy we are and whether the application is complete. Complete is the key. Get your sketch right and it moves faster."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:44:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'll draw it up. I do woodworking, so I got sawdust all down my sleeves here, sorry if I'm breathing heavy. Just came in from the shop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:44:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. You can pick up the application at the counter here at City Hall, or I can have someone point you to it on the city website."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:45:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll swing by. You're open today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:45:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, we're here till four-thirty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:45:12-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thanks, Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:45:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Take care."
    }
  ],
